	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's like you stepped straight out of the television.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I give her my honest impression.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"A certain girl stands right before me, still slightly out of breath after just finishing her dance routine.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I doubt there's even a single person in the Empire who\nhasn't at least heard of her.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"This girl whose dazzling costume is only matched by her gorgeous singing voice.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"This shining star of hope for the Empire's eventual restoration by the name of Natsumi.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll say it as many times as I need. You look amazing.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know, um... you're just so cute.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Th-Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"For some reason, coming out and saying it feels incredibly awkward.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I wonder if it's because my relationship with Hotori is deeper than it used to be.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But you know, when I'm Natsumi, I'm not just yours. I belong to all of my ≪fans≫ equally.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"If memory serves, ≪fan≫ is a Republican word that refers to “an enthusiastic supporter.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So flattery won't get you anywhere, got it?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She mutters to me in a bashful voice.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, you don't have to tell me.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, why did you have to change into your costume?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Dressing up like this helps me get into it when I practice.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So, what'd you think?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your singing and dancing were both perfect. Just what I'd expect from Natsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“From what I could tell, there wasn't a single thing wrong with your performance.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Jeez, what was even the point of showing you then?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori sighs with her hands on her hips.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"As for why Hotori is in my room doing this in the first place...",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"It all started today at lunchtime.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's up?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Hotori calls out to me during break.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Will you be free tonight?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have work at the shop, but I shouldn't be too busy.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you need me for anything, I don't mind keeping you company.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“U-Um, if it's okay with you... can I come by your room?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My room? I don't mind, but...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I glance over in Akari's direction.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You don't need to ask me for permission, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have better things to do than get in the way of your little late-night tryst.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not a tr-tryst!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Too much information, girl!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Shino shakes her head in disapproval.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Next to her, Kotone does the exact same thing.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is the height of malice to speak of such things in front of us single women.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aren't you all getting the wrong idea here?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I just wanted to show him a little this and that...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might you be showing him?!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whew, that's bold.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, it's not anything weird...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is still light outside! To speak of such matters at a time and place like this is rather...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon for my impertinence, but perhaps such stimulating discussion is best continued behind closed doors...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Kotone can't contain the slight blush spreading across her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I told you! That's not what I meant!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, it's not? Laaame.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why are you acting so disappointed?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't worry 'bout it.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Shino waves away my question.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That said, it's still for Soujin's eyes only, right?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, I can't show it to you, but it's not what you're thinking!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's... you know, umm...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Hotori casts furtive glances all around us.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Does it have to do with Natsumi?)”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I whisper into Hotori's ear.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Y-Yeah...)”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"There are plenty of other students still in the classroom.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"It'd be dangerous to unthinkingly let slip that Hotori is secretly Natsumi.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"That must be why she's so hesitant to say it.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(The truth is, I want you to check out the choreography for my new song...)”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"She whispers, looking up at me with imploring eyes.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(You got it.)”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"How can I possibly say no to her when she asks me like that?",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Though it's not like I ever planned on saying no in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahem... ahem!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Might you two not be getting a wee bit ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"too",
{"/font"},
" close?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hah?!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Hotori practically leaps away from me.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Those two certainly get along awfully well...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“They sure are a real eyesore...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“L-Listen to me!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"I smile to myself as I watch Hotori continue bickering with them, growing redder and redder all the while.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Which brings us to where we are.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"As soon as Hotori got to my room, she wasted no time changing into her Natsumi outfit.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"After which she immediately performed her routine for me before grilling me for feedback.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll show you one more time, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Make sure you watch closely this time.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"As soon as Hotori begins her song and dance, my eyes are immediately drawn to her.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"She's as beautiful as ever...",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I've watched her countless times on television, but that's nothing compared to watching her in person.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"She's just as beautiful when fighting on the battlefield, but as she is now, there is a completely different kind of mystique about her.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The former has the beauty of the precarious glint of a naked spellblade; the latter, the beauty of a rampant bloom of wildflowers.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"As she is now, how could every last Imperial help but fall captive to the force of nature that is Natsumi's irresistible charm?",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"And to think that right now, in this room, I have her all to myself...",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, how was I?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Hotori strikes a final pose and looks expectantly in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fantastic!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Jeez, that's all you ever say.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's because it's the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your singing and dancing are both perfect. I guarantee it.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, if you say so, I suppose I'll have to believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Even though she doesn't seem fully satisfied, she still shows me a contented smile.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I head downstairs to close up shop while Hotori takes a breather.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The manager asked me to take care of things before vanishing not a moment later.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"He's likely intending to have a long night out on the city.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I turn on the television in the store to accompany me as I work on in silence.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"By pure coincidence, Natsumi shows up on the screen.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"It looks like this program is a special feature on her.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“'Thank you for all your support, everyone!'”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“'I hope my next song will fire you all right up!☆'”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Natsumi says with one eye cutely closed.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, they're airing this today?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Seeing it like this is so embarrassing...”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"When I turn around, I see Hotori standing there, still in her Natsumi outfit.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"She has a faint blush on her face as she watches herself singing on screen.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, should you really come outside like that?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"There'll be a big commotion if any passersby catch sight of her.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll just stay right here.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"She says as she sits down in the back corner of the shop.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She probably isn't visible from outside, but I still can't help but be worried.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should head back upstairs.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I wanna be with you...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Or is having me here... too distracting?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Hotori says with a mischievous grin.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"She knows exactly what my answer is going to be.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Do whatever you want.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehe, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Strangely enough, when Hotori's the one toying with me like this, I don't mind in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Smiling wryly at myself for being such a pushover, I turn my eyes back to the television.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you really have to watch? It's embarrassing.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ooh... Can I turn it off?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is being broadcast all over the Empire. At this point,\nwhat's there to be embarrassed about?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Th-That's true, but still...”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Hotori watches the program with me, fidgeting with embarrassment all the while.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"It's a rather strange feeling to have the person you're watching on television also be standing right next to you.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"The broadcast pans over to show a long queue of fans eagerly waiting to shake Natsumi's hand.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"The Natsumi on screen shakes each of their hands with a dazzling smile.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is this one of those handshake events?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Hotori gives a bashful reply, looking obviously uncomfortable.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"All the while, the Hotori on the screen is taking her time to politely shake each person's hand.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"She gives her undivided attention to everyone that steps up to greet her.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"This sort of conduct is probably what's expected out of a famous singer.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"I know that she's only doing her job.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"And yet, I still seem to be having trouble coming to terms with it...",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"This feeling of restlessness in my chest surely wasn't there even just a few minutes ago.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The next scene that comes up on the screen, however, leaves me at a complete loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"A swimsuit-clad Hotori is being ogled from all sides by a crowd of people.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"It seems like they're filming a commercial of some sorts.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"She's brazenly flaunting her body for everyone to see right there on the television...",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You seriously agreed to a job like this?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“W-Well, they were really pushing for it, so I couldn't just say no...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you... mad at me?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not mad.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Even as I say it, I realize I'm basically admitting that I actually am.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"I'll bet that she thinks I'm jealous of her fans.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I never realized until now how much I want her all to myself.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It feels like you and I live in totally different worlds.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's not true at all!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Hotori interjects in a panicked tone.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll always be right here next to you, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But Natsumi belongs to everyone, doesn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's just Natsumi. Inou Hotori is all yours.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Sorry for acting so weird.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, right now, you're Natsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does Natsumi really belong to everyone, I wonder?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I hook my arm around her waist and draw her in close.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Before she can even react, I cradle her cheek with my other hand and steal away her lips.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nhhn... nng...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, what's gotten into you all of a...? Nnnh...!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Hotori stiffens up at first, but soon gives herself up to my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nnh... fuh... chlp...”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Hotori puckers up her lips and eagerly receives my own.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"She's making me want her so badly.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The Natsumi that belongs to all her fans, I want her all to myself.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
