			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mhm... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"When I finally release her lips, Hotori breathes out a long, quivering sigh.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"She silently peers into me with glistening, upturned eyes.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you want more than just a kiss?”",
