			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give me a second.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I reluctantly let go of Hotori and pull down the storefront's shutters.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Cut off from all prying eyes, I waste no time in taking up Hotori in my arms once again.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"The erotic thrill of Natsumi's presence accentuated both of our arousal.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"And in return, we completely sullied her costume.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Looks like my costume is totally ruined now.”",
