			{
"Hotori peers searchingly into my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"She asked it as a casual question, but her face shows just how serious she is.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"It seems my jealousy from earlier is affecting her.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, you shouldn't quit.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You shouldn't have to go that far because I'm so petty.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But you don't like it, right? If it'd make you happy, I'd─”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The people of the Empire look up to Natsumi. They need you.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"I interrupt her before she can finish her sentence.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Plus, the Sworn Blades need the funds that Natsumi raises.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I might have lots more photo shoots and handshake events, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll put up with it... somehow.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"I can't keep the twinge of sadness out of my voice.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
