			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehe. Thank you, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The truth is, I actually wanted to keep being Natsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I want to use Natsumi's position to inspire the people of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"The emotional scars left from the war still run deep for many Imperial citizens.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"And the Sworn Blades are powerless to heal them.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Hotori is doing that which we cannot.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"There's no way I wouldn't stand behind her.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
